# Additional CVE raised to address remaining URL corruption issue - pending fix release to <3.14.3 releases.
CVE-2026-4786

# Fix included in Python 3.14.5 release - Grype database still showing as vulnerable. Confirmed patch included in 3.14.5 (commit 48c3c7f) release, waiting for Grype DB update.
CVE-2026-6100

# base64 decode failure in Python. Fixed in Python 3.13.13 - Pending fix release to 3.12 releases. Only exploitable when parsing untrusted base64 data with `base64.b64decode()`. Use `validate=True` to mitigate in the meantime.
CVE-2026-3446

# Arbitrary file access in Python. Fixed in upstream branches with the exception of 3.12 - Pending inclusion of fix in 3.12, 3.13 and 3.14 releases. Only exploitable if uncompressing untrusted tar files with tarfile modules.
CVE-2026-11940

# Exponential archive parsing in Python. Fixed in upstream branches with the exception of 3.12 - Pending inclusion of fix in 3.12, 3.13 and 3.14 releases. Only exploitable if opening tar archives using streaming mode.
CVE-2026-11972

# Installation path traversal. Doesn't impact this image - issue only impacts the Windows installer.
CVE-2026-12003

# CRLF injection in Python. Fixed in upstream branches with the exception of 3.12 - Pending inclusion of fix in 3.12, 3.13 and 3.14 releases.
CVE-2026-0864

# HTML/Script injection in http.cookies.Morsel.js_output(). Fixed in 3.13.14, 3.14.5rc1, 3.15.0b1 - no 3.12 backport available yet.
CVE-2026-6019

# SSRF in ftplib.ftpcp() via PASV bypass. Patch committed to 3.12 branch (commit c887044) - awaiting 3.12.14 release.
CVE-2026-8328

# Path traversal via tarfile.data_filter bypass. Patch committed to 3.12 branch (commit 0d28f5e) - awaiting 3.12.14 release.
CVE-2026-7774

# CPU consumption / DoS in unicodedata.normalize(). Fixed in 3.13.14, 3.14.6, 3.15.0b2 - 3.12 backport PR open (cpython#150843), pending merge and release.
CVE-2026-3276

# Stack-based buffer overflow in bz2.BZ2Decompressor reuse after error. Fixed in 3.13.14, 3.14.6, 3.15.0b3 - 3.12 backport PR open (cpython#151057), pending merge and release.
CVE-2026-9669

# Hash flooding / insufficient entropy in xml.parsers.expat and xml.etree.ElementTree. Fixed in 3.13.14, 3.14.6, 3.15.0b2 - 3.12 backport blocked pending cpython#151401.
CVE-2026-7210

# ==========================
# pip vendored dependency issues
# ==========================

# Outdated msgpack bundled inside pip's own pip/_vendor/msgpack (pip 26.2, the latest release). Not the top-level msgpack package, which is already pinned to the fixed 1.2.1 release in the Dockerfile. Only used internally by pip's HTTP cache; waiting for pip to update its vendored copy.
GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964

# Outdated setuptools referenced in pip's own pip/_vendor/vendor.txt (pip 26.2, the latest release). Not the top-level setuptools package, which is already pinned to the fixed 83.0.0 release in the Dockerfile. Waiting for pip to update its vendored reference.
CVE-2025-47273
CVE-2026-59890
